  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Rub the yolks of the eggs smooth with the oil, add the sugar, salt, mustard and pepper, and when these are well mixed, the vinegar, a few drops at a time",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Set it by, covered, while you cut the fish into strips about an inch long, and shred the lettuce",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix these in a salad bowl, pour over the dressing and garnish with rings of the whites of the eggs",
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve as soon as it is ready or the lettuce will become limp",
      "section": null
